{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Untitled Discourses on Craving For Sights, Etc.","html":"<article id='an11.358-405'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Aṅguttara Nikāya 11 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Numbered Discourses 11.358–405 </span></li>\n<li class='pannasaka'><span class='root'>Paṭhamapaṇṇāsaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The First Fifty </span></li>\n<li class='vagga'><span class='root'>Sāmaññavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Similarity </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>~ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Untitled Discourses on Craving For Sights, Etc. </span></h1></header>\n<p><span class='root'>… </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>… </span>\n<span class='root'>Rūpataṇhāya… </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“… craving for sights … </span>\n<span class='root'>saddataṇhāya… </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>craving for sounds … </span>\n<span class='root'>gandhataṇhāya… </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>craving for smells … </span>\n<span class='root'>rasataṇhāya… </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>craving for tastes … </span>\n<span class='root'>phoṭṭhabbataṇhāya… </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>craving for touches … </span>\n<span class='root'>dhammataṇhāya… </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>craving for ideas. …” </span></p></article>"}
